IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RING-ATTN-V2.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CONTEXT-LEN         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 RING-SIZE           PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 CHUNK-TOKENS        PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PIPELINE-SEGS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RING-ATTN-V2.
    IF CONTEXT-LEN == 0 OR RING-SIZE == 0 OR CHUNK-TOKENS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE CONTEXT-LEN TO PIPELINE-SEGS.
    DIVIDE CHUNK-TOKENS INTO PIPELINE-SEGS.
    IF PIPELINE-SEGS == 0
        MOVE 1 TO PIPELINE-SEGS.
    END-IF.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 PIPELINE-SEGS.
    WEIGHT 30 RING-SIZE.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
